{"seed":97101,"ar":{"seed":97101,"anchorCommit":"561f9701e383","mode":"baseline","post":{"mode":"baseline","sounded":false,"day":null,"soundTick":null,"preSoundReadiness":null,"deferral":null,"stoodDownDay":null,"stoodDownReason":null,"readyButAbsentDays":[],"linkCountBefore":null,"linkCountAfter":null,"actualAllies":null,"perVillage":null,"respondersVerified":null,"responderProblems":[],"commitReturns":[],"havenAfter":null,"havenVids":null,"readyAfter":null,"interceptorErrors":[],"checkTrajectory":[],"tickChecks":[],"projectionSkipped":0,"projectionSkipReasons":[]},"transcript":["A person, maybe 40s, with sun-creased eyes heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 30s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 40s, with a nervous tic heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 40s, with a shaved head heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Everett heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Miguel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 40s, with a long braid heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Tashi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ulises heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Boris heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Farid heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Anna heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Boris heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Pavel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Anna heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Farid heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ulises heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","Ulises heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Greta heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Pavel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Boris heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Lwazi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ulises heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Miguel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🔥 The fire settles. Anna has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Tick — I put it down today.\" \"It waits. The questing legs wave — the tell.\" \"Adjacent = attached. No dodge. It's ON you.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Lwazi mutters \"We've been walking past those.\" Everett asks \"Tell me you didn't go alone.\" Someone at the edge of the light says what everyone's thinking: \"So — what are we calling it?\"","📓 Codex: First link formed with Stonebridge. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","👥 Miguel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","Fatima waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Everett heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Anna heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Miguel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Anna heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ulises heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Lwazi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Miguel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Ulises heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ben waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to The Hungry Road with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Lwazi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Spool: Feed it nothing. It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence. (Farid lived to tell it, twice — the village pieced it together.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Feed it nothing — It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Pavel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tashi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Miguel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Greta heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Lwazi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Anna heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ulises heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Anna heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Anna heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🗣️ Pavel to Miguel, by the fire: \"It waits. We wait. Somebody should check the snares — the table doesn't fill the pantry.\"","Ulises heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","👥 Anna heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Boris heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Ulises heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Oscar waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","◈ THE TABLE IS SET. A ring of pale light waits — take your seat from Haven when you are ready. Nothing is final until you sit."],"deferred":false,"sounded":false,"stoodDown":false,"deferDay":null,"soundDay":null,"soundTick":null,"stoodDownDay":null,"firstCheck":null,"firstCheckArrearsOnly":null,"firstCheckReady":null,"firstCheckTotal":null,"checkTrajectory":[],"tickChecks":[],"refusalTrajectory":[],"refusalCountTotal":0,"foughtBeforeTriggerDays":[],"foughtAfterDays":[],"refusedAfterDays":[],"heraldAttempts":[],"fightOutcome":null,"musterRefusals":[],"musterCalls":{"soundTitanCall":0,"titanCommitOwn":0,"titanSelfDo":0,"titanWarCouncil":0},"musterErrs":0,"musterErrors":[],"instrumentErrors":[],"maxWave":4,"wave4":1,"wave5":0,"w4Day":58,"w5Day":null,"national":0,"table":1,"won":1,"days":90,"gameDays":90,"e