er first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Hannah heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Elif waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Elif waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","👥 Aurora heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","Elif waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Fatima waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Dmitri waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Ashford with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Elif waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","🔥 The fire settles. Hannah has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Tick — I put it down today.\" \"It waits. The questing legs wave — the tell.\" \"Adjacent = attached. No dodge. It's ON you.\" A beat of silence, then the qu