t for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Desmond heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Fatima heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Fatima heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Fatima heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Sandra heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Miguel waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Miguel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Zuri heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","Giulia heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","📓 Codex: First link formed with Stonebridge. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Miguel heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Miguel waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Diego heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Sandra he