mes something new.)","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Elena heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Swastika waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Aki heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Mason heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Elena heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Amina heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","Mariana heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","Swastika waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","👥 Daniyar heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Mariana heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Naran heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Elena heads 