t for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 50s, with calloused knuckles heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","A woman, maybe 20s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","A man, maybe 50s, with calloused knuckles heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 20s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Pedro heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Catalina heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Tariq heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Tariq waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Hermann heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Wamaitha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Pedro heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tariq heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Wamaitha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Tariq waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tariq heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Wamaitha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Pedro heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","Pedro heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","🔥 The fire settles. Wanjiru has been quiet all evening, and now everyone knows why. \"Tick — I put it down today.\" \"It waits. The questing legs wave — the tell.\" \"Adjacent = attached. No dodge. It's ON you.\" A beat of silence, then the questions come all at once. Aisling asks \"So it bleeds.\" Catalina breathes \"Tell me you didn't go alone.\" Someone at the edge of the light says what everyone's thinking: \"So — what are we calling it?\"","Wamaitha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Tariq waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","👥 Tariq heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Tariq heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Deshawn waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Stonebridge with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Wanjiru heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Tariq waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Pedro heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Wanjiru heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Oliver heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Tariq waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Wanjiru heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Hermann heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Yara heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Tariq waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Oliver leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Nightlight. Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Nightlight: Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Never wade in — The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Tariq waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Aisling heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Yara heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Tariq heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Catalina heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Yara heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Aisling heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Wamaitha heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Pedro heads out for water. \"