ds out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Hassan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Eric waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Hassan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Maya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A woman, maybe 20s, with a wiry build heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","Ibrahim heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Eric waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Hassan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Maya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Sofia waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Hassan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Eric waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Valeria heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🛖 Raised bins, sealed lids, clay and cool dark. The granary stands full of food that waits — smoked, dried, rendered, patient. Whatever comes, Haven eats a while longer.","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","Andre waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Thornfield with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","👥 Hassan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Pamela heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Eric waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Madi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Aria heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Maya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Aria heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Pamela heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Eric waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","Sofia waits two days at your fire, getting thinner. Nobody answers. They walk back to Emberhold with nothing. They'll remember the silence.","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Maya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Eric waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Madi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Aria heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Pamela heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Valeria heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Pamela heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Eric waits until the fire's lit and people are watching. Then, loud enough for all of them: \"Who put YOU in charge?\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Pamela heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Aria heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Valeria heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Pamela heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🗣️ Madi to Ibrahim, by the fire: \"It waits. We wait. Somebody should check the snares — the table doesn't fill the pantry.\"","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.