o.","Maya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Big-Eyes: Feed it nothing. It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence. (Kusi lived to tell it, twice — the village pieced it together.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Feed it nothing — It records your strikes and plays them back. Give it waits and heals while it records and the replay is silence.","◈ THE TABLE IS SET. A ring of pale light waits — take your seat from Haven when you are ready. Nothing is final until you sit.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","👥 Hassan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Maya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Maya heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Kusi heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Hassan heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👥 Chantal heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A weathered trader waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too."],"deferred":false,"sounded":false,"stoodDown":false,"deferDay":null,"soundDay":null,"soundTick":null,"stoodDownDay":null,"firstCheck":{"kind":"refusal","day":80,"snapIdx":0,"links":[{"villageId":"village_0","name":"Emberhold","trust":84,"opinion":15,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"already":0,"snapFree":0,"generatedHere":true,"freeAdults":5,"wouldRefuse":false,"contribution":5,"naiveContribution":5,"faces":["Talia Nair","Yuki Novak","Nadia Zhang","June Rhee","Amara Ortiz"]},{"villageId":"village_1","name":"Stonebridge","trust":84,"opinion":22,"arrears":0,"quota":6,"already":0,"snapFree":6,"