{"seed":97108,"ar":{"seed":97108,"anchorCommit":"561f9701e383","mode":"baseline","post":{"mode":"baseline","sounded":false,"day":null,"soundTick":null,"preSoundReadiness":null,"deferral":null,"stoodDownDay":null,"stoodDownReason":null,"readyButAbsentDays":[],"linkCountBefore":null,"linkCountAfter":null,"actualAllies":null,"perVillage":null,"respondersVerified":null,"responderProblems":[],"commitReturns":[],"havenAfter":null,"havenVids":null,"readyAfter":null,"interceptorErrors":[],"checkTrajectory":[],"tickChecks":[],"projectionSkipped":0,"projectionSkipReasons":[]},"transcript":["A woman, maybe 60s, with ink-stained fingers heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 30s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Owen heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A man, maybe 50s heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","👁 It waits for YOU to come close — the stillness is the trap. Spot the shape before you're in reach, and strike first. It only gets one.","A woman, maybe 60s, with a scarred cheek heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Greta heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","🎁 \"We watched your first week! You're good at... let us see...\" (A gift awaits — choose an ability.)","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Owen heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Xavier heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Greta heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Nino heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","(Evolution awaits — choose one. Your power becomes something new.)","Erin heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A cart-driver with flour on their sleeves waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Akulyna heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","Each trial takes a FULL day-part and leaves you drained (−250 kcal). Pick one. The System waits — it has already run the simulations, and it is terrible at keeping secrets.","📓 Codex: First link formed with Emberhold. The gesture goes out now; the Dawn waits for seasons.","🎁 \"OH! You can hold more now! We've been HOLDING this — take it, take it, take it!\" (The System's gift awaits — choose an ability.)","A frightened family waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Erin heads out for water. \"Water first. Everything else waits.\"","A curious wanderer waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","A lean scout waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels about that, too.","Akulyna leans in, voice low. \"Here's what we figured out about Nightlight. Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.\"","💡 COUNTER LEARNED — Nightlight: Never wade in. The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp. (Someone at the haven knew the trick.)","📓 Codex: Counter: Never wade in — The glow is a mouth — it waits for you to come close. Never wade in. Strike the light from two squares out and it's just a fish with a lamp.","A sharp-eyed peddler waits a while, then moves on down the road. Word travels a